IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `fa-formulas`

-- A New Tax System (Family Assistance) Act 1999, Sch 1 cll 3, 19B-22, 25, 25D, 38B-38F; Sch 4 cll 4-6 -- worked cases for
-- fa-formulas.l4: rent assistance, the maintenance income test and FTB Part A with both, and indexation.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Expected values were worked by hand from the
-- text and the sidecar formulas (cll 20A(2), 38D; Sch 4 cl 5(1)) before running. Dollar figures are the rates AS PRINTED in
-- Compilation No. 124 (indexed, so not the amounts paid in any year); rents, incomes, maintenance and CPI index numbers are
-- ASSUMPTIONS. Fixtures were generated by the scratchpad script gen_fa_cases.py from a table of facts; no expected value comes
-- from it. Rounding to the cent is not encoded (as in fa-families.l4), so some answers carry fractions of a cent.

§ `Fixtures`

